WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
Translate a past negative: didn't + base verb.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:13.300
“I didn't worked” repeats the past. “I no worked” leaves out did. Days take on.

3
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.100
“I didn't work on Monday.” “did not” or “last Monday” are also accepted.
